{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_cgbird_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_cgbird_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"藍色羽毛與歌","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cgbird_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"863bb843c10bfd5650d3ab9b3591df4bd42f33adbdc95f69b9eab51c50a19bef","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"4:37 P. M. 天氣/晴\n萊塔尼亞東北部某村莊"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦啊，盧卡他看起來越來越難受了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽，我好疼啊......好疼......我的腿，我腿上像是有火在燒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，盧卡，你忍一下，不能叫太大聲。隔壁湯瑪斯家會聽見的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你是最堅強的男子漢。要是忍不了的話，就咬住這枕頭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"棉花都要被咬爛啦！他出了這麼多汗，而且還在發燒。我......我們還是帶他去找馬科斯醫生吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。這行不通的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看，你看看他的腿......這一小塊黑黑的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"是礦石......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，不要說出來，現在別說出來。別讓盧卡聽見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"上回雅尼克家的本，他的手上也長出了這個，然後他就被帶走了。你知道的，他們再也沒讓他回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......盧卡......我的盧卡，絕不能讓他們把他帶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"只能這樣子。我們只能這樣......熬過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽......媽媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"咬這個吧，咬爸爸的手。盧卡，再忍一忍......我的小男子漢，你會好起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"會有奇跡......我相信會有奇跡發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只能相信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請問有人嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"敲門聲！竟然有人在這時候找上門，他們是來帶走盧卡的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"別害怕，我去窗戶那裡看一眼。你抱著盧卡，待在房間裡別出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"庫蘭塔？看打扮還是個騎士？我們這種小村子裡可不多見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你不用擔心，我們只是幾個流浪的醫者，剛好路過這裡，想問你借一杯水喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好。只是一杯水，你要是敢喝，我當然也不會拒絕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"連這個杯子一起拿去吧。喝完趕緊走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，麗茲？我想這水沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺到了......無聲的痛苦......就在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"對。雖然微弱，但很清晰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在呼救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你們這麼說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生，請問你家有礦石病患者嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病！你、你怎麼敢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"他很疼吧？可還沒有絕望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以......治療他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你......這個角......這個角的形狀！你、還有你，你們是魔族人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，請你冷靜一下。就像我剛才介紹的，我們是醫生。如果你家裡真有礦石病患者，我們可以幫助他緩解病情。這並不需要任何回報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經說了——我們這裡沒有病人，更不需要什麼治療！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧，滿嘴謊言的庫蘭塔！還有你們，魔族人，你們離我家遠一些！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"看來那位先生打定了主意，不願意讓我們治療他的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"類似的事情並不少見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"通常情況下，醫者與病人之間必須建立信賴關係。而他無法信任我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"他看起來很緊張。或許因為我們的身份，讓他產生了戒備心理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"這回連一貫很受歡迎的臨光都敗下陣來，更不必說我與麗茲。薩卡茲的名聲在哪裡都不夠好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我們可以嘗試說服這位先生，就像以前很多次那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"前提是我們沒有遇上憲兵隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。說服一隊憲兵，要比說服一位病人的親屬困難得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我們目前需要儘量避免那種“說服”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這段時間麗茲的身體一直不太好......我同意，我們不該冒險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"就是可惜那位病人，拖下去的話，情況會越來越糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......很難受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲，你哪裡不舒服嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"那個孩子，他很難受......他被關在那個小小的房間裡，忍受著病痛的煎熬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲說的對，那個孩子確實被關著。就連痛呼都是壓抑著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說他們在虐待感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是這樣。那位父親......他在提到礦石病的時候，臉上並沒有流露仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"在其他地方，仇恨遍地都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，莫非是為了保護病人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說萊塔尼亞人會把感染者從家裡帶走，讓他們集中起來生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"如果得病的真是剛才那位先生的孩子，他是不希望孩子被憲兵帶走，才想拼命捂住這個消息吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"這份關心，正在漸漸帶走他孩子的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"困在名為愛的牢籠裡，錯過生存的希望，全身的活力漸漸枯竭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要再想這些了。悲傷的情緒會對你的身體造成負累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"今天趕了很多路，你的疲憊肉眼可見。你需要休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"靠著我會不會好一些？帳篷快搭好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"生個火，吃些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"天快黑了。萊塔尼亞的憲兵隊速度很快。他們或許明天就會來到這裡，為了避免麻煩，我們最好在他們到來之前離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，出現在他們面前不是很好的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲，我扶你在這躺下。這裡離火堆更近，暖和些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"休息吧，我會守著你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"是憲兵隊。他們果然來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈你醒了？明明才睡下沒多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"夠久了。我們馬上離開這裡。麗茲，你能走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你的臉色看起來很蒼白。昨晚沒有休息好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我還好，只是有些頭暈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"憲兵隊的人衝著昨天那位先生家裡去了。閃靈，我們真的應該就這樣離開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......灌木叢後面的位置還算隱蔽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在這裡的話，他們看不到我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光，扶好麗茲。萬一情況不對，隨機應變。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞憲兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萊斯先生！請您把門打開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞憲兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萊斯先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"憲兵先生，您瞧！我就說老萊斯家裡有問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前些日子他家小兒子——那個叫盧卡的男孩，從附近田地玩耍回來，突然就病倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之後這幾天，他家就關緊了大門，任誰叫都不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我只是為了照顧盧卡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這話我沒法相信！是什麼病會讓一個結實的孩子一病不起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，要是盧卡真的只是簡簡單單的生病，你們為何不帶他去找馬科斯醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞憲兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來是不大對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是吧，憲兵先生！我這是為了大家的安全考慮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們這裡......這美好而寧靜的村子，可經不起礦石病的肆虐啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞憲兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對。所有感染者都必須集中到附近的隔離區去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對嘛！老萊斯，你聽聽。只是去隔離區而已，在那裡小盧卡會得到更好的照顧，不比藏在家裡好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞憲兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是什麼呢，萊斯先生？您今天必須把這門打開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，爸爸，你快點開門吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我都餓壞了，我想吃麵包。一片不夠，我現在可以一口氣吃下五六片呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦——咦？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是湯瑪斯叔叔，真抱歉撞到了您。我急著回家吃早飯，不然我媽媽一定會罵我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"盧卡啊，你總算回來了。一大早就跑出門，玩了這麼久才回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"真不好意思啊憲兵先生，這就是我兒子盧卡。不是我不願意開門，是他剛才確實不在家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞憲兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這健壯活潑的孩子就是盧卡？他真的在生病嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，一點小風寒罷了。這個年紀的小男孩，誰不會因為貪玩而生點小病呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞憲兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看也是。我見過的感染者多了去了，沒有哪個像這樣活蹦亂跳的。馬科斯醫生，您說呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦......哦？您是說檢查嗎？我來看一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧這結實的小胳膊，全是汗，摸起來平平整整。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有腿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，真是有力的小腿。挺多泥巴的，這孩子剛剛玩得真瘋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的鄰居","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"給馬科斯醫生添麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啦......好啦！憲兵先生，這忙了一個大清早，我的肚子也餓得咕咕叫，老眼昏花的，再也看不出啥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們放這小夥子回家吃麵包吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您不必擔心，要是後面小盧卡又生病了，我會好好檢查。有問題的話一定通知您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，好險......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"盧卡，我的小男子漢，快讓爸爸好好瞧瞧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的......真的好了？有力氣跑跳，也吃得下飯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"這些礦石......倒是還在，小了許多，邊緣也沒那麼紅腫了，瞧起來好了不少，難怪馬科斯醫生第一眼沒發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這就是奇跡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，不是奇跡，是小羽獸把我治好啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......小羽獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是好漂亮、好漂亮的羽獸啊！它的羽毛比最藍的湖水還要藍！我從來沒有見過這麼好看的小羽獸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上，它從窗戶裡飛了進來，停在我的床頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有一團潔白的光包裹著這隻小小的羽獸。那個光，好明亮，又好溫暖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它們一起靠向我，我一下子就感覺不到痛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"一隻羽獸？還是會發光的羽獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！千真萬確呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我可憐的孩子，一定是你病糊塗了，生出了幻覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是幻覺，還有歌呢，我真的聽到了，那隻藍色的小羽獸在對我唱歌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，沒事了，沒事了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無奈的父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，神奇的藍色羽獸，無論你是真的假的——當然是假的——無論如何，謝謝你給了我的盧卡一個美夢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......你沒有生氣吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我為什麼而生氣呢？為了那隻趁著夜色飛去病人身邊的小鳥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"哦對，那隻鳥還會發光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉閃靈。昨天晚上，我看麗茲無法安眠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈，是我請求臨光幫助我去治療那孩子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"否則我......我睡不著。我一直醒著，腦子裡都是那孩子痛苦的呻吟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是我的腿......要不是我的腿沒力氣，我會自己去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要責怪臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要道歉。我們本就是醫者，你們只不過做了該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到今天憲兵隊真的來人了......不知道那孩子和他的家人之後會怎樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"或許會從此安生度日，又或許用不了多久，他們就必須搬家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"醫者只能撫平一時的傷痛，沒有辦法真的將壞的變成好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的，閃靈，可是我想不了那麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......那個孩子，他很疼很疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我看著他，就好像我也很疼很疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我只知道我能讓他不那麼疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我想幫助他......我可以幫他減輕病痛......我想幫他離開那房間，讓他重新跑起來、跳起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲，我只有一個問題。你看著我。你告訴我，你是覺得自己必須這麼做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼是......必須？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"就像過去那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"過去那樣......我不想像過去那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候是他們來找我。我被關著......哪裡都去不了。我不得不去治療他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"現在......現在是我走很多地方。我去找他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到那些生病的、受傷的人。我感受他們的痛苦。我希望他們不要繼續痛下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我伸出雙手......擁抱他們的傷痛。我讓我的小鳥，去他們耳畔唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想到，那孩子能看見我的小鳥。他在睡夢中笑得很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"在那個時候，我的眼前......那些亂亂的、始終扎著我的碎片不見了。小鳥的舞蹈也變得很輕盈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"那是不是就是高興？閃靈，這麼說的話，我似乎也很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。這是我要的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，麗茲，這就是高興。你懂得什麼是高興了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎？原來這就是高興？那我現在也......唔......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你很難受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，閃靈......我好像很難受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"這......麗茲為什麼會變成這樣？她甚至沒有站起來的力氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"因為她的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......因為她在昨天晚上治療了那個孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。她的身體狀況本來就很糟糕，使用簡單的治療法術也會對她造成負擔，何況是處理急性礦石病。現在她越來越......瀕臨極限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道這樣的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道這樣的話，你會阻止她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想那樣做。我想治療那個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽，這就是麗茲的願望。哪怕她因此而傷痕累累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......閃靈，我想我沒有辦法阻止她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，這就是選擇——你們的選擇。你和麗茲一樣，為了拯救看得見或者看不見的苦痛，你們總是會選擇犧牲自己的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我本該......尊重你們的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"閃靈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"但我希望......我希望，麗茲還能有更多的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你，瑪嘉烈。我希望你也能有更多的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"更多的選擇，那是什麼意思呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是一直想看看外面的世界嗎，麗茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，這是我最大的心願。我跟著你，閃靈，我們和臨光一起，已經走了許多地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"這些地方......很美。有時候，仇恨和傷痛遮蓋了天空和大地，而我依然能看到疤痕下面流淌著的美麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......我還想看到更多。不僅僅是我的小鳥兒唱給我聽的那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是時候去看看更廣闊的世界了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛好像做了一個決定，閃靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光，你還記得上次那個病人提到的醫藥公司嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說......羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"對，羅德島。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在一起行走的這些年，一共治療了多少病人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不記得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"不記得也沒關係。麗茲，想不想一起去治癒更多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"想......我想去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"好。那你呢，臨光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島嗎......我沒有異議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你，也願意相信你的決定。如果麗茲想去，那麼我們就帶她去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"既然已經決定，那麼，就出發吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......去羅德島。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["閃靈"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["臨光"]},{"speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","aliases":["夜鶯"]}]}
